From: Haldexx
Subject: [PATCH] noblelte: remove KernelSU

KernelSU grants root to a manager app and modifies the loaded SELinux
policy at runtime. The production kernel does not include it.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/exynos7420-noblelte_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/exynos7420-noblelte_defconfig
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/exynos7420-noblelte_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/exynos7420-noblelte_defconfig
@@ -4165,7 +4165,7 @@
 #
 # KernelSU
 #
-CONFIG_KSU=y
+# CONFIG_KSU is not set
 # CONFIG_KSU_DEBUG is not set
 # CONFIG_KSU_THRONE_TRACKER_ALWAYS_THREADED is not set
 # CONFIG_KSU_ALLOWLIST_WORKAROUND is not set
